      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auburn%2C_Nebraska",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Burlington and Missouri Railroad chose the site, purchased the land, and established Auburn as a rail depot.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
