      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "From 1910 to 1913, the Auburn Athletics played Class‑C baseball at Legion Memorial Park in the Missouri‑Iowa‑Nebraska‑Kansas League.",
